{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Lethal Haven </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a high-intensity world where every shot counts and every detail matters. Built by a passionate developer who loves games, Lethal Haven delivers a unique mix of survival tension, zombie horror and action all in one immersive package.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/7177bf23aeea6e744b02f327f14596db.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> puts you straight into the action with a compact yet gripping  experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Mode</strong> challenges you to survive endless waves in two unique maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/683b93463cd05196bb824ee92021a070.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons &amp; Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience skill-based, crosshair-free combat that rewards accuracy and instinct. Master realistic bullet ray casting, terrain-based hit effects, dynamic blood impacts, and physics-driven footprint sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/e58fcd8281c6093680065e7593534e6c.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across destructible environments, watch the terrain change with the landscape deformation system, and interact with the world\u00a0 from bursting pipelines to sparking electrical boxes. Advanced health, reload, and equipment systems make every encounter feel authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/77f5693a3bf96d2491a5f129f13d0327.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camera Freedom &amp; Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of Lethal Haven\u2019s standout features is its <strong>versatile camera system</strong>, designed for the best player experience across multiple perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between <strong>First-person</strong>, <strong>Third-person</strong>, <strong>Ultrawide First-person</strong>, and <strong>Cinematic</strong> modes. Hide the HUD for total immersion, or show it when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can smoothly adjust third-person camera angles, giving you the perfect view for intense combat or detailed exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/f584cf4b14f65b3d9a3337aee420b6ab.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environments &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snow-covered wastelands to dense forests and industrial zones, every map is alive with detail. Explosions, environmental reactions, and subtle touches create a world that feels truly reactive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/a1f3effa736308ebcf771e4da4bdd70d.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lethal Haven</strong> is developed with passion by a sole creator, and will continue to evolve with future updates adding new features, and surprises.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951950?t=1773763672","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951950?t=1773763672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/b71442104e10ffa2e684060eb361c758474552d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773763672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/b71442104e10ffa2e684060eb361c758474552d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773763672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Lethal Haven </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a high-intensity world where every shot counts and every detail matters. Built by a passionate developer who loves games, Lethal Haven delivers a unique mix of survival tension, zombie horror and action all in one immersive package.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/7177bf23aeea6e744b02f327f14596db.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> puts you straight into the action with a compact yet gripping  experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Mode</strong> challenges you to survive endless waves in two unique maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/683b93463cd05196bb824ee92021a070.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons &amp; Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience skill-based, crosshair-free combat that rewards accuracy and instinct. Master realistic bullet ray casting, terrain-based hit effects, dynamic blood impacts, and physics-driven footprint sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/e58fcd8281c6093680065e7593534e6c.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across destructible environments, watch the terrain change with the landscape deformation system, and interact with the world\u00a0 from bursting pipelines to sparking electrical boxes. Advanced health, reload, and equipment systems make every encounter feel authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/77f5693a3bf96d2491a5f129f13d0327.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camera Freedom &amp; Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of Lethal Haven\u2019s standout features is its <strong>versatile camera system</strong>, designed for the best player experience across multiple perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between <strong>First-person</strong>, <strong>Third-person</strong>, <strong>Ultrawide First-person</strong>, and <strong>Cinematic</strong> modes. Hide the HUD for total immersion, or show it when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can smoothly adjust third-person camera angles, giving you the perfect view for intense combat or detailed exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/f584cf4b14f65b3d9a3337aee420b6ab.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environments &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snow-covered wastelands to dense forests and industrial zones, every map is alive with detail. Explosions, environmental reactions, and subtle touches create a world that feels truly reactive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/extras/a1f3effa736308ebcf771e4da4bdd70d.avif?t=1773763672\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lethal Haven</strong> is developed with passion by a sole creator, and will continue to evolve with future updates adding new features, and surprises.</h2>","developers":["Nishal Basheer"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951950/1cec880ce8e58ed8e073e690161d32c189893181/header.jpg?t=1773763672","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> wetwt<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> wetwtwet<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 212 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> dasfaf</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> twetew<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> twetwetwe<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 123 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> asffsa</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> geger<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> erterter<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 23 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> safaf</li></ul>","re